  "notes": [
   "28"
  ]
 },
 {
  "slide": 13,
  "texts": [
   "(1) Your advisor is an ",
   "input-output machine",
   "Mentor/Advisor",
   "❌ ",
   "Input only: ",
   "\tYou do everything and report the final results.",
   "❌ ",
   "Output only: ",
   "\tYou do everything that they told you to do.",
   "✅ ",
   "In-N-Out: ",
   "\tFrequent updates and frequent feedback."
  ],
  "images": [
   "slide13-1.jpeg",
   "slide13-2.png"
  ],
  "notes": [
   "29"
  ]
 },
 {
  "slide": 14,
  "texts": [
   "(2) Show your work",
   "Mentor/Advisor",
   "❌ ",
   "Show your success only",
   "✅ ",
   "Show your work",
   "What did you do? ",
   "Why did you do it? ",
   "How did you do it?",
   "What did you find?",
   "Why did you think it make sense?"
  ],
  "images": [
   "slide14-1.jpeg",
   "slide14-2.jpeg"
  ],
  "notes": [
   "35"
  ]
 },
 {
  "slide": 15,
  "texts": [
   "(3) Present failures",
   "Mentor/Advisor",
   "❌ “",
   "It doesn’t work.”",
   "✅ ",
   "Present failures",
   "”I’ve narrowed down the problem to step B. Until step A, you can see that it works, because you put in X and you get Y out, as we expect. You can see how it fails here at B. I’ve ruled out W and Z as the cause.”",
   "How to do research by Bill Freeman"
  ],
  "images": [
   "slide15-1.jpeg",
   "slide15-2.jpeg"
  ],
  "notes": []
 },
 {
  "slide": 16,
  "texts": [
